    "description": "Blinq is the derivatives layer for prediction markets on Monad, restructuring short-term price action into fixed-window, USDC-settled trading products. Price Arena offers Up/Down (direction) and Momentum (relative performance) predictions on BTC, ETH, and SOL, while Candle Rush lets users call whether the next 5M/15M/30M candle closes green or red. Pricing is powered by Pyth oracles with gasless smart-account execution.",
